windows.gaming.input: opt-in XInput pads as Gamepads (MADEIRA_WGI_HOST_PADS=1).
Taken unchanged from willfaust/wine madeira-lgpl e656d1e8 (bahacan16's PR #40),
which is not in this repository's wine pin (257f271). Applied by
tools/build-wine-extra-dlls.sh with `git apply`; the source is restored after.

